else
{
send(players[index].peer_id,"play_s signpress.ogg",0);
send(players[index].peer_id,"dlg Hey. you seem to have the beginnings of a great hunter. would you mind helping me out? my brother and I need the corpses of some animals which we are going to transfer to crystal city. problem is, neither he nor I are great hunters. if you could kill 200 animals in this forest and report to my brother, the two of uss will collect their corpses, and give you ten millian dollars. if you want to help us out go kill the animals, then find my brother in the forest to collect your reward.",0);
}
}
