send(players[index].peer_id,"dlg by now you probably know how the creatures got seeled. may the legendary paul and his companions rest in peace. however, dark times are upon us once again. a band of criminals calling themselves the unseelers are on the move. their gole is to reach the land of the seeled and unleash the creatures back in to the world. through our sources we have learned that they have technology advanced enough so their leader can take control of the creatures, making them an instrument of his own will. we need to stop them at all caust. if the unseelers succeed everything existing will be put on the edge of destruction. your next mission is to infiltrate the unseelers base. you have to defeat the unseelers genral and bring him back so we can question him. our hopes depend on you now. do your best, because if you fail, the world as we know could change...and not for the better.",0);
}
}
else if(round(players[index].x,0)==100 and round(players[index].y,0)==100 and players[index].z==0 and players[index].map=="memories_of_prehistory")
