send(players[index].peer_id,"dlg in a time when technology was not even an imagination, a time which history does not even remember, there existed creatures which now are known as prehistoric for some, and entirely fictional for others. these creatures inhabited the earth the same way humans did, only with more powers and abilities. these creatures were violent and destructive, the apex predators of their age. compared to these creatures who's powers exceeded far beyond humans, the survival of humanity was impossible... until the actions of a man named paul, and his friends. these small group of humans were the greatest aura users of their time, their techniques unmatched, their spell casting flawless. with their powers united, they fought the creatures, pitting their powers against them. however... no matter how powerful they were, they were still humans. they could not compete against the forces of nature itself. soon enough, every single aura user was killed, everyone besides paul. desperately wanting humanity to be preserved, paul, in his dying moments, used all   his power in a single spell, seeling away the entire land in a large field of aura, seeling away the creatures. the spell was so strong that it continues to work even in the present time. the land where these creatures are seeled can be seen and observed from a distance, however try as they might, the creatures cannot get off the land... neither can anything or anyone else get in. to this day, those creatures live in captivity, seeled by the power of a man who gave everything to preserve his race.",0);
